From: ACK72 <acikom72@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 22:56:33 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: coalesce NPU station statistics and unlock RSSI waits

Poll global station statistics once per device interval while retaining
per-PHY counters, deadlines, error backoff, WED and NPU packet reporting.
Preserve software byte and MLO accounting. Release the device mutex during
solicited RSSI waits and reject replies across station reuse or MCU reset.
Dispatch ALL_STA event tags once, retaining event bounds and delta rules.

Consolidates ACK72 patches 0020, 0023, 0030.

Adapted-from: Gilly <gilroyscott1970@gmail.com>, patches 039 and 046
Source: https://github.com/Gilly1970/Gemtek-W1700K-6.18/tree/4b8fb8c3a2619dd239fb44fd511ee2848a07e768/openwrt-patches

diff --git a/package/kernel/mt76/patches/9999-zzz-mt7996-device-sta-poll.patch b/package/kernel/mt76/patches/9999-zzz-mt7996-device-sta-poll.patch
new file mode 100644
