+Poll global station statistics once per device interval while retaining
+per-PHY counters, deadlines, error backoff, WED and NPU packet reporting.
+Preserve software byte and MLO accounting. Release the device mutex during
+solicited RSSI waits and reject replies across station reuse or MCU reset.
+Dispatch ALL_STA event tags once, retaining event bounds and delta rules.
